OL,3,ANational security can't come at expense
OL,4,Aof social security, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has said national security
OL,7,F"can't come at the expense of social
OL,8,Fsecurity", as he was challenged over
OL,9,Ffunding for defence at Prime Minister's
OL,10,FQuestions.
OL,12,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,13,Fpressed Burnham over whether he would
OL,14,Fspend 3% of GDP on defence by 2030 and
OL,15,Fhow he would pay for this.
OL,17,FThe PM said the government's commitment
OL,18,Fto defence was "absolute" and he would
OL,19,Fset a target date to reach the 3%
OL,20,Ffigure in the spring.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
