OL,3,ANorway's royal family waves to crowds
OL,4,Afrom palace balcony after King Harald's
OL,5,Afuneral
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe late monarch died in August after
OL,8,F35 years on the throne - here's a mini
OL,9,Fprofile of the 89-year-old. His son,
OL,10,FHaakon VIII, has now succeeded him
OL,12,FPrince William is representing King
OL,13,FCharles while Princess Anne - godmother
OL,14,Fto the new Norwegian king - is in
OL,15,Fattendance but in a private capacity
OL,17,FAs well as European royalty,
OL,18,Finternational figures such as King
OL,19,FAbdullah II of Jordan and Ukraine's
OL,20,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky are at the
OL,21,Ffuneral
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
